<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN CUP QUARTER-FINAL FIRST LEG RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN CUP QUARTER-FINAL FIRST LEG RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Italian Cup quarter-final first leg matches played on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Cremonese 1 Bologna 3 (halftime 1-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Cremonese - Riccardo Maspero (38)</p>
<p>Bologna - Kennet Andersson (22, 90), Massimo Susic (own goal, 77)</p>
<p>Attendance: 3,400</p>
